# python.wasm is not stored in version control due to its binary size (~15-25 MB).
#
# Obtain a pre-built WASI-compiled CPython binary from one of:
#   - VMware Labs WebAssembly Language Runtimes:
#     https://github.com/vmware-labs/webassembly-language-runtimes/releases
#   - Official CPython WASM builds (wasm32-wasi target):
#     https://github.com/brettcannon/cpython-wasi-build/releases
#
# Place the binary here as `python.wasm` before installing the tool.
#
# A future Bioconda package (python-wasm) may provide this dependency
# automatically via the standard <requirement> mechanism.
